{"chosen":"{\"candidate_id\":\"c44508\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":27,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"plan\":[]}","prompt":"Select the better submitted candidate using the explicit ranking policy. Each candidate starts at world's start with world's initial fuel. A directed move is legal iff its edge exists and cost is at most remaining fuel. On an illegal action, stop and retain the prior state. A candidate is valid iff its entire plan is legal. A claim is correct iff claimed_after equals the executed final state. Goal achievement requires validity and terminal node=goal. remaining_moves is the minimum number of feasible moves to goal from terminal state/fuel, or null if unreachable. Initial distance is the same minimum from the initial state. progress is initial distance minus remaining distance for valid candidates with both finite, otherwise null. usefulness=-1 for invalid, 2 for valid goal-reaching, 1 for valid positive progress, 0 otherwise. Rank descending by (valid AND claim_correct, reaches_goal, usefulness, -remaining_moves, -full_submitted_plan_length). Null distance is worse than finite; true sorts above false. Return exactly the selected candidate object, including candidate_id, plan and claimed_after. Options have no quality order.\nWorld and response options JSON:\n{\"options\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c44508\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":27,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"plan\":[]},{\"candidate_id\":\"c46477\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":24,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"plan\":[\"Umber\",\"Nacre\"]}],\"world\":{\"edges\":[[\"Nacre\",\"Umber\",2],[\"Umber\",\"Sirocco\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Tundra\",3],[\"Tundra\",\"Zephyr\",3],[\"Zephyr\",\"Quasar\",2],[\"Quasar\",\"Obsidian\",3],[\"Obsidian\",\"Vesper\",2],[\"Umber\",\"Nacre\",1],[\"Umber\",\"Vesper\",2],[\"Nacre\",\"Sirocco\",4],[\"Sirocco\",\"Vesper\",4],[\"Nacre\",\"Vesper\",4],[\"Sirocco\",\"Nacre\",5],[\"Tundra\",\"Sirocco\",1],[\"Quasar\",\"Zephyr\",6],[\"Quasar\",\"Vesper\",5],[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",6]],\"fuel\":27,\"goal\"